==Event Information==
<!--Event Information based on reference, October 2nd, 2023-->
Time to celebrate {{Color|#FF0000|'''9 Years'''}} of The Battle Cats!!<br>
Whether you're a brand new player or have been supporting us since 2014, we thank you for enjoying our game!<br>
We couldn't have made it to 9 years without amazing and loyal players from all over the world!<br>
Lets kick off the real celebration with a spectacular set of special events, capsules and rewards!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Enjoy 9th Anniversary Celebration events from September 18th (11:00am) through October 23rd, 2023 (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Grab a huge amount of Cat food for the 9th anniversary with Wildcat Slots!'''}}<br>
Match up all nines to earn a feast of Cat Food!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between September 18th (11:00am) and October 1st (11:59pm)!'''}}

Check the Cat Base during the event to find the {{Color|#008000|'''Wildcat Slots'''}} available!<br>
Big prizes await {{Color|#FF0000|'''starting at 900 Cat Food'''}}! Don't miss this chance to earn big!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Several special offers come together at once!'''}}<br>
Get special perks for playing The Battle Cats for a limited time!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Starting September 18, 2023 (11:00) get a discount of your first Capsule pull!'''}}<br>
All players get a half-off discount on the Cat Food cost of their first Rare Capsule draw following this 9th Anniversary reset! Your first {{Color|#FF0000|'''Single Draw'''}} (normally 150 Cat Food) will cost only {{Color|#FF0000|'''30 Cat Food!'''}}<br>
And your first {{Color|#FF0000|'''11-Capsule Draw'''}} (normally 1500 Cat Food) will cost you only {{Color|#FF0000|'''750 Cat Food!'''}}

※ If the First Time discount fails to appear, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Half-Off Energy Cost for Empire, Future and Cosmos stages!'''}}<br>
During this event, the Cat Energy cost to challenge stages in the '''Empire of Cats''', {{Color|#008000|'''Into the Future'''}}, or {{Color|#0000FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} will be half the normal cost each day during the times below!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''7:00am ~ 8:59am / 12:00pm ~ 1:59pm / 7:00pm ~ 8:59pm'''}}

※ This Cat Energy cost reduction does not apply to Zombie Outbreak stages.<br>
※ If the Cat Energy reduction does not appear at the listed times above, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Weekends Only: 50% Off Cat Food Discount on Special Cats'''}}<br>
Each Friday, Saturday and Sunday during this Anniversary event, pick up all the Special Cats at half the cost and expand your strategic potential!<br>
Complete your collection by taking advantage of this special offer!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Platinum Ticket Sale!'''}}<br>
Only during this event, pick up Platinum Tickets to boost your army!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between September 18th (11:00am) and October 23rd (10:59am)!'''}}

Get a guaranteed Uber Rare Cat with every Platinum Ticket you use at the Uber Only Platinum Capsules! Don't miss this chance to get top-class heroes!

※ One Platinum Ticket per user account can be bought during this event.<br>
※ If the Platinum Ticket offer does not appear, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version.<br>
※ Certain units from Seasonal Rare Capsules, Collab Capsules, and Girls & Monsters sets cannot be collected from Platinum Capsule draws.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Super Limited Unit: "Gacha Cat" ON SALE!'''}}<br>
Gacha Cat is now part of a special [[Gacha Cat (Special Cat)|Gacha Cat]] Set on sale for the 9th anniversary and spinning more than ever! Grab one while you can!

※ The Gacha Cat Set can only be purchased once per user account during the sale period.<br>
※ If you have previously purchased Gacha Cat during a past event, you may not purchase this sale pack again.<br>
※ If the Gacha Cat Sale fails to appear as scheduled, update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●9th Anniversary Special Stages!'''}}<br>
Five special anniverary stages will be eavailabe where every week, Cat Tickets, XP, and item rewards are up for grabs!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Cybear's Vengeance Returns for the 9th Anniversary!'''}}<br>
Your chance to collect a pile of Cat Tickets! The Deadly challenge "Cybear's Vengeance" is here for a limited time!

Clear the stage when it appears at the time below and you'll pick up a stack of {{Color|#FF0000|'''5 Cat Tickets'''}}!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・September 18th, 2023 (11:00am) thru September 24th (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・September 25th, 2023 (12:00am) thru October 1st (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・October 2nd, 2023 (12:00am) thru October 8th (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
