{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・October 16th, 2023 (12:00am) thru October 23rd (10:59am)'''}}

{{Color|#008000|'''The stage can be cleared and rewards collected once during each event period!'''}}<br>
Plus, the very first time you clear this stage, you will collect a bonus reward of {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''30 Cat Food'''}}!

{{Color|#46BDC6|'''XP Festival! is back again! Get ready to power up your Cats to the max with the special stages Blitz XP, XP Megablitz, and XP Colosseum and the all-new stage Merciless XP every day at Stories of Legend/Event Stages!'''}}

