{{Color|#FF9900|'''・9th Anniversary Event All Stars map: Super Present DX!'''}}<br>
A limited addition to the Event All Stars series of special maps, available only for a limited time! Collect awesome item rewards on stage clear!

Seasonal enemies stand in your way! Can you fight them off? Earn victory to pick up random rewards of {{Color|#FF0000|'''super useful battle items!'''}}<br>
Available from October 2nd, 2023 (11:00) until October 23, 2023 (10:59) at the times below. Clear the stages as many times as you can before they disappear!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''6:00am ~ 8:59am / 12:00pm ~ 2:59pm / 7:00pm ~ 10:59pm'''}}

Plus, earn {{Color|#46BDC6|'''30 Cat Food'''}} each time you clear an All-Stars stage for the first time!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Catclaw Dojo Challenges'''}}<br>
Get your strongest soldiers of the Cat Army ready, the Dojo Ranking Event is here throughout the 9th Anniversary Campaign and it's time to prove yourself!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between September 18th (11:00am) and October 23rd (10:59am)!'''}}

Head to the Catclaw Dojo from the Battle Cats Title Menu and enter the Arena of Honor to join in the challenge! Climb to the highest tiers of power as your scores are measured against all other Battle Cats players? Can you make it to the top 10%?

Try as many times as you like before the event ends, and earn a special prize when your final high score determines your skill tier on October 16th! Tap the Rewards List button to see what you might win as you climb the rankings!

Plus, collect bonus rewards for completing the anniversary dojo mission at the Catnip Challenges!

※ 9th Anniversary dojo mission rewards can only be collected until the end of this campaign on October 16th, 2023 (10:59am). If the collect button is not pressed for a completed mission before this deadline, the rewards will become unavailable.<br>
※ Your Ranking Result will be shown in the Catclaw Dojo, but rewards will be claimed by visiting the Mailbox menu from the Battle Cats title screen. It may take a short while after the end of this event before your rewards are delivered. Thank you for your patience!<br>
※ Rewards will expire and become unclaimable 30 days after delivery.<br>
※ Scores achieved during this ranking event will be reset once the next ranking event begins.<br>
※ Accounts flagged for hacking or modding will have their Dojo event scores invalidated and may receive a playing ban.<br>
※ Empire of Cats Ch. 1 must be cleared before the Catclaw Dojo will be available to access.<br>
※ If Dojo events do not appear even if the conditions are met, please ensure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Special 9th Anniversary Missions Available!'''}}<br>
Complete a special anniversary mission to clear {{Color|#46BDC6|'''Empire of Cats Ch. 1'''}}, then head to the Catnip Challenges Special Missions section to claim your prize of one {{Color|#FF0000|'''Platinum Ticket'''}}, that can be exchanged for a draw of one guaranteed Uber Rare hero at the Rare Capsule machine!<br>
Take on other anniversary event-only Special Missions as well for extra rewards!

※ After completing the mission, you must claim your prize at the Catnip Challenges before October 23rd, 2023 (10:59am). If you do not claim your prize before then, you will not be able to earn the reward.<br>
※ Even players {{Color|#FF0000|'''who have already cleared Empire of Cats Ch. 1 can collect this reward!'''}}

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Daily Treasure Festivals!'''}}<br>
During this event, get increased Treasure Drop Rates in Story Mode chapters for a special {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Treasure Festival'''}}, all day every day!<br>
{{Color|#FF9900|'''On'''}} {{Color|#008000|'''even days'''}} visit {{Color|#008000|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, and on {{Color|#46BDC6|'''odd days'''}} head to {{Color|#46BDC6|'''Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos'''}} on {{Color|#0000FF|'''9/19, 9/22, 9/25, 9/28, 10/1, 10/4, 10/7, 10/10, 10/13, 10/16, 10/19, 10/22!'''}}

※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● 9th Anniversary Special Stages!'''}}<br>
Challenge the {{Color|#FF00FF|'''B-Day Gifts!'''}} map to earn a {{Color|#FF0000|'''20 Cat Food reward'''}} on your first clear each day.<br>
The stage rewards will {{Color|#008000|'''reset once each day at 12:00am'''}}, so clear it again and again until the end of the event to pick up a daily Cat Food prize!<br>
If you clear the stage each and every day of this event, you can pick up a {{Color|#FF0000|'''max total of 720 Cat Food!'''}}<br>
Plus, don't miss out on the Birthday Present mission in the Catnip Challenges!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Areas'''}}<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited areas {{Color|#46BDC6|'''Cats Eye Cave'''}} and {{Color|#46BDC6|'''XP Harvest'''}} for a special set of Cats Eye rewards!<br>
Get as many Cats Eyes as you can and help your units break through to even higher levels!

・XP Harvest (3 areas)<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between September 18th (11:00am) and September 25th (10:59am)!'''}}

・Cats Eye Cave<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between September 25th (11:00am) and October 2nd (10:59am)!'''}}

Don't miss this special chance!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Catfruit / Catseye Item Capsule Events!'''}}<br>
At the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between standard Capsule events and the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catfruit Item Capsules'''}} & {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catseye Item Capsules'''}}!<br>
Power up your Cats! Don't miss out on these cool items!

・Catseye Item Capsules<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between September 18th (11:00am) and September 25th (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
・Catfruit Item Capsules<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between September 25th (11:00am) and October 2nd (10:59am)!'''}}

At the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between standard Capsule events and the Catseye Limited Capsules & Catfruit Limited Capsules!<br>
Power up your Cats! Don't miss out on these cool items!

※The Catfruit Limited Capsules provide Catfruit and XP rewards, while Catseye Limited Capsules will provide Catseyes and XP!<br>
※Catfruit Limited Capsules will appear after Empire of Cats Ch. 3 is completed in The Battle Cats, and Catseye Limited Capsules will appear in the Cat Capsules once User Rank 1600 is cleared.

