==Trivia==
*Originally, the English versions 9th anniversary was going to debut on September 11th, 2023 however this was changed quickly due to [[wikipedia:September 11 attacks|obvious reasons]].
*During the Japanese versions 9th anniversary, many instances of the number nine was replaced with the letter Q. This is because nine sounds similar to the letter Q in Japanese, being Kyū.

